<item><title>Niger transport director warns Tahoua carriers of firm rule enforcement</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-transport-director-warns-tahoua-carriers-of-firm-rule-3193d5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-transport-director-warns-tahoua-carriers-of-firm-rule-3193d5/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>At a meeting on Friday, Oumarou Ibrahim urged freight and fuel operators to curb overloading and keep vehicles, papers and drivers compliant.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:57:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-transport-director-warns-tahoua-carriers-of-firm-rule-3193d5/share.jpg" length="44668" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-transport-director-warns-tahoua-carriers-of-firm-rule-3193d5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Niger opens 100-place centre for children facing family difficulties</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-opens-100-place-centre-for-children-facing-family-e9e68d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-opens-100-place-centre-for-children-facing-family-e9e68d/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>The Niamey facility, built with the NGO International Humanitarian Relief Foundation (IHH), includes classrooms, dormitories and a medical and social services building.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:49:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" length="31036" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
